# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms — free, no backend required).
#
# Setup:
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter meyoratech@gmail.com
#   2. Web3Forms emails you an Access Key (a UUID)
#   3. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below
#   4. Restart `npm run dev`
#
# Submissions are delivered to the inbox that registered the key.
# Without this key the form shows a message asking visitors to email directly.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
